  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Int, +1 Con Speed: 30 feet. Skill Proficiencies: Chakra Control, Survival Passive Affinity: You begin with the Fire release affinity.\nIburi Techniques: The Iburi Clan has access to a separate list of jutsu unique to their clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the normal jutsu list(s).\nHijutsu Flexibility: Iburi Clan Hijutsu can use either Constitution or Intelligence as its casting ability score.\nSmoke Free Zone: Whenever you would enter an area obscured by smoke, mist or even a gas that is naturally occurring and not jutsu based, you can passively dispel it as your travel through, clearing your space of the obscuring haze.",
